WEBVTT

00:07.257 --> 00:08.758
How amazing.

00:08.842 --> 00:09.968
How strong.

00:14.723 --> 00:15.682
That's enough!

00:17.600 --> 00:19.686
Kanao, you're really fast.

00:22.147 --> 00:24.774
Today's result is ten wins and ten losses.

00:25.442 --> 00:27.110
I still haven't trained enough.

00:27.193 --> 00:28.445
I'll go for a few laps.

00:28.528 --> 00:30.030
Are you guys up for it?

00:30.113 --> 00:32.574
Do we have to maintain
Constant Total Concentration Breathing?

00:32.657 --> 00:33.616
Yes.

00:35.994 --> 00:37.746
Do we have to keep doing this?

00:37.829 --> 00:38.997
Monjiro!

00:42.125 --> 00:43.960
What a buffed fool.

00:44.043 --> 00:45.044
Let's go.

00:51.843 --> 00:56.014
A FEW MONTHS AGO

00:56.681 --> 00:57.640
LOWER MOON SIX

01:03.313 --> 01:05.273
What's this place?

01:06.608 --> 01:08.401
LOWER MOON ONE

01:15.408 --> 01:17.077
LOWER MOON TWO

01:17.994 --> 01:20.038
Is this that woman's Blood Demon Art?

01:20.622 --> 01:24.584
It seems that this space is centered
around that woman and became distorted.

01:45.188 --> 01:49.192
Only the Lower Moons
of Twelve Demon Moons are gathered here.

01:49.275 --> 01:51.194
This is my first encounter
of this situation.

01:52.612 --> 01:54.697
Lower Moon Five isn't here yet.

01:56.741 --> 01:57.617
The space moved.

01:57.700 --> 01:59.202
It's caused by the Blood Demon Art.

02:07.168 --> 02:09.170
Who's this woman exactly?

02:11.339 --> 02:12.382
Who is she?

02:15.009 --> 02:17.178
Bow your head and kneel.

02:18.930 --> 02:20.348
Prostrate yourselves.

02:26.437 --> 02:27.939
It's Lord Muzan.

02:28.022 --> 02:29.023
It's Lord Muzan's voice.

02:29.107 --> 02:30.316
I didn't realize it at all.

02:31.192 --> 02:33.862
His appearance and smell
have changed completely.

02:34.821 --> 02:36.823
His shape shifting power is so precise!

02:38.408 --> 02:40.285
I'm so sorry.

02:40.368 --> 02:42.453
Because your appearance
and smell have changed--

02:42.537 --> 02:45.123
Did I give you permission to talk?

02:45.206 --> 02:48.668
Based on your meaningless thinking,
you have no right to speak.

02:48.751 --> 02:51.629
Just answer my question.

02:53.798 --> 02:55.758
Rui was murdered.

02:56.634 --> 02:58.177
He was Lower Moon Five.

02:59.554 --> 03:02.015
I only have one question.

03:02.807 --> 03:06.686
How could the Lower Moons be so weak?

03:07.520 --> 03:11.482
Even if you join the Twelve Demon Moons,
it doesn't signify the end.

03:11.566 --> 03:13.776
It only signifies a new start.

03:13.860 --> 03:17.155
Consume more humans
so that you'll grow stronger.

03:17.238 --> 03:20.283
It's time for you to start helping me out.

03:21.618 --> 03:23.244
For over a century,

03:23.328 --> 03:26.789
the Upper Moons of Twelve Demon Moons
have never been replaced.

03:27.332 --> 03:30.084
The ones who killed the Hashiras
among the demon slayers

03:30.168 --> 03:32.587
have always been Upper Moons.

03:32.670 --> 03:34.631
What about the Lower Moons?

03:34.714 --> 03:36.799
Why are you guys always replaced?

03:36.883 --> 03:39.802
Even if you tell us
this kind of thing, we…

03:39.886 --> 03:42.805
"Even if you tell us
this kind of thing, we…"

03:44.182 --> 03:46.476
What is it? Tell me.

03:46.559 --> 03:48.770
Can he read my mind?

03:49.520 --> 03:50.688
This is bad.

03:50.772 --> 03:52.357
What's bad?

03:53.024 --> 03:54.275
Tell me.

03:56.986 --> 03:59.656
Please forgive me, Lord Kibutsuji!

04:00.365 --> 04:01.616
I beg you.

04:01.699 --> 04:03.409
Please have mercy on me.

04:04.077 --> 04:07.413
Please forgive me!

04:13.795 --> 04:15.713
Why did this happen?

04:16.673 --> 04:18.132
Will he kill me too?

04:18.716 --> 04:21.469
I finally become part
of Twelve Demon Moons.

04:21.552 --> 04:23.638
Why?

04:24.222 --> 04:27.642
From now on, I will work harder.

04:27.725 --> 04:31.020
Are the demon slayers scarier than me?

04:32.230 --> 04:33.231
No!

04:33.314 --> 04:37.360
Every time you meet the Hashiras
among the demon slayers,

04:37.443 --> 04:39.946
all you think about
is running away, right?

04:40.029 --> 04:41.739
No, that's not what I think!

04:41.823 --> 04:45.576
I'm willing to put my life
on the line and fight for you!

04:45.660 --> 04:49.205
Did you just deny what I said?

04:58.423 --> 05:00.508
This is bad. I'm doomed.

05:01.467 --> 05:02.802
He can read our mind.

05:02.885 --> 05:05.263
It doesn't matter if we speak or not,
he'll kill us.

05:06.222 --> 05:08.433
Even if I fight him,
it's impossible to win.

05:10.059 --> 05:11.102
Then…

05:13.896 --> 05:15.023
I can only run!

05:20.987 --> 05:23.239
How foolish.

05:23.323 --> 05:24.866
I must figure out an escape route.

05:24.949 --> 05:26.034
Somehow…

05:26.117 --> 05:27.660
I've run so far. I should be…

05:27.744 --> 05:29.078
LOWER MOON THREE

05:31.831 --> 05:36.002
It seems Twelve Demon Moons
is sufficient with only Upper Moons.

05:36.085 --> 05:38.212
The Lower Moons will be disbanded.

05:39.255 --> 05:40.631
He caught me?

05:41.883 --> 05:43.426
How did this happen?

05:43.509 --> 05:45.386
Is this the power
of that female biwa player?

05:45.470 --> 05:48.473
No, I didn't hear the sound of biwa.

05:49.599 --> 05:51.267
Why?

05:51.350 --> 05:53.561
My body can't regenerate.

06:08.951 --> 06:11.954
Do you have any last words?

06:13.623 --> 06:15.625
I can still work for you.

06:15.708 --> 06:19.462
If you're willing to give me more time,
I'll definitely come in handy.

06:19.545 --> 06:22.298
Specifically, how much time do you need?

06:22.882 --> 06:25.301
How would you be useful to me?

06:26.094 --> 06:29.806
What can you do for me
with your current strength?

06:30.932 --> 06:32.016
Blood!

06:32.975 --> 06:34.894
If you're willing to give me your blood,

06:34.977 --> 06:38.064
I'll definitely be able to withstand
and adapt to your blood

06:38.147 --> 06:40.900
and become a stronger demon
to fight for you.

06:40.983 --> 06:45.363
Why must I listen to you
and give you my blood?

06:45.988 --> 06:47.824
You're so shameless.

06:47.907 --> 06:49.784
Who do you think you are?

06:51.077 --> 06:53.830
You've got it wrong! I…

06:54.455 --> 06:55.456
Shut up.

06:55.540 --> 06:57.125
I've got nothing wrong.

06:57.792 --> 07:00.086
I never make a mistake.

07:00.169 --> 07:02.797
Every decision is mine to make.

07:02.880 --> 07:05.591
My words are absolute.

07:06.509 --> 07:08.636
You don't have the right to deny.

07:08.719 --> 07:12.014
If I think it's right,
then it's definitely right.

07:13.141 --> 07:15.601
How dare you give me instructions?

07:16.227 --> 07:17.979
Of course, you deserve death.

07:25.153 --> 07:27.488
What are your last words?

07:28.781 --> 07:30.658
This guy will get killed too.

07:32.034 --> 07:34.954
Our life and death
depend on our lord's mood.

07:36.122 --> 07:37.915
I'm dead for sure.

07:40.209 --> 07:41.794
You're right.

07:45.006 --> 07:47.925
I feel like I just had a good dream.

07:48.426 --> 07:51.929
It's an honor to die in your hands.

07:52.430 --> 07:56.184
I'm pleased to hear the wailing
of other demons before they die.

07:57.185 --> 07:59.353
I'm way too happy now

08:00.605 --> 08:04.650
because I love watching others
when they are miserable and suffering.

08:04.734 --> 08:07.528
It's the feeling of pleasure
from having a sweet dream.

08:07.612 --> 08:11.199
Thank you for saving me until the end.

08:28.674 --> 08:30.092
I admire you.

08:30.176 --> 08:33.262
I'll give a large concentration
of my blood to you.

08:33.346 --> 08:37.016
You might die
because you can't withstand it.

08:37.892 --> 08:40.228
However, if you were able to adapt,

08:40.311 --> 08:42.813
you will receive
a drastic increase in power.

08:43.481 --> 08:45.900
After that, you will work for me.

08:46.609 --> 08:49.070
Kill the Hashiras among the demon slayers.

08:51.280 --> 08:55.409
If you were able to kill the demon slayer
wearing hanafuda earrings,

08:55.493 --> 08:57.620
I'll share more of my blood with you.

09:21.018 --> 09:22.186
What happened?

09:22.270 --> 09:23.938
It seems like I saw something.

09:24.021 --> 09:27.567
That thing and Lord Muzan's blood
entered my body together.

09:31.988 --> 09:36.534
If I kill the Hashiras and this child,
I'll get more blood.

09:36.617 --> 09:38.369
It's like I'm having a sweet dream.

09:42.707 --> 09:45.293
It's morning! Wake up!

09:45.376 --> 09:46.919
What's wrong?

09:47.003 --> 09:48.921
Did anything happen?

09:49.630 --> 09:52.508
Casualties on the Infinite Train
has increased.

09:52.592 --> 09:55.428
More than 40 people are missing.

09:55.928 --> 09:59.599
Travel to the scene and rendezvous
with Kyojuro Rengoku.

09:59.682 --> 10:02.226
Head west at once.

10:03.269 --> 10:07.857
I already assigned the Infinite Train's
mission to Tanjiro and the others.

10:09.150 --> 10:13.112
Can I hear your reason
for recommending Tanjiro?

10:14.155 --> 10:15.948
Tanjiro has always been brave
in moving forward.

10:16.032 --> 10:18.451
He can work towards his goal
one step at a time.

10:19.035 --> 10:22.455
Through this way of growth,
he may give us unexpected results.

10:23.289 --> 10:24.707
Most importantly,

10:24.790 --> 10:29.378
he has a clear goal to defeat Kibutsuji.

10:30.379 --> 10:33.174
Regarding this point,
I have the same opinion.

10:34.342 --> 10:40.056
Also, I heard Tanjiro said
that his dad used Breath of the Sun.

10:42.683 --> 10:46.687
With his current state, I won't deny
that his power is still insufficient.

10:46.771 --> 10:48.814
I was thinking that
the Flame Hashira, Mr. Rengoku,

10:48.898 --> 10:51.651
will be able to guide him
and make him stronger.

10:52.610 --> 10:54.028
You're right.

10:54.111 --> 10:57.573
His younger sister doesn't consume humans
despite being a demon

10:58.115 --> 11:01.410
and he bumped into Kibutsuji.

11:02.078 --> 11:06.374
From these two incidents, Tanjiro can be
a child born with a special destiny.

11:08.626 --> 11:10.461
All right, I'm heading out.

11:13.506 --> 11:14.715
Someone's coming.

11:18.552 --> 11:20.846
I already avoided him,
but he still bumped into me.

11:22.640 --> 11:24.475
Wait, that guy…

11:25.184 --> 11:26.977
He was at the Final Selection.

11:30.689 --> 11:33.526
In this short period of time,
he grew so tall and buffed.

11:34.693 --> 11:37.488
But what's with this smell?

11:38.614 --> 11:41.367
Long time no see!
It's good to see that you're doing well!

11:46.247 --> 11:47.498
I see.

11:47.581 --> 11:48.749
You're leaving.

11:49.500 --> 11:53.254
Although it wasn't long, it has been
a pleasure spending time with you.

11:53.337 --> 11:54.630
Please do your best.

11:55.714 --> 11:57.007
Be careful on the road.

11:57.633 --> 12:00.344
You were so busy,
but you still took care of us.

12:00.428 --> 12:01.762
Thank you very much!

12:01.846 --> 12:03.764
Thanks to you, I can fight again.

12:06.725 --> 12:08.185
Don't thank me.

12:09.311 --> 12:11.730
I was lucky enough to survive
during the Final Selection.

12:12.523 --> 12:16.402
After that, I'm just a coward
who can't fight because of my fears.

12:19.405 --> 12:20.865
That's not true.

12:22.199 --> 12:26.328
You already became a part of me
because you helped me, Ms. Aoi.

12:26.912 --> 12:30.166
I'll carry your will
to the battlefield, Ms. Aoi.

12:32.376 --> 12:33.252
See you!

12:33.335 --> 12:35.254
If I get hurt again,
I'll have to trouble you!

12:43.679 --> 12:45.181
I found you!

12:46.557 --> 12:47.600
Kanao!

12:48.184 --> 12:49.768
We're heading out.

12:49.852 --> 12:51.020
Thank you for everything.

12:57.485 --> 12:58.486
What is it?

13:05.159 --> 13:06.035
TAILS

13:08.579 --> 13:11.207
I only followed my master's instructions.

13:11.874 --> 13:14.210
You don't have to thank me.

13:14.793 --> 13:15.836
Goodbye.

13:16.754 --> 13:18.297
She talked to me!

13:18.797 --> 13:20.466
What did you throw just now?

13:20.549 --> 13:21.634
Goodbye.

13:21.717 --> 13:22.676
Was it a coin?

13:22.760 --> 13:24.470
"Heads" and "tails" are written on it.

13:24.553 --> 13:25.930
Why did you throw it?

13:26.013 --> 13:27.097
Goodbye.

13:27.181 --> 13:28.766
It's spinning so much.

13:29.850 --> 13:32.770
When I don't receive instructions,
I'll throw this to decide.

13:33.395 --> 13:36.649
I was deciding whether
I should talk to you just now.

13:36.732 --> 13:39.652
If it's heads, I won't talk.
If it's tails, I will.

13:40.319 --> 13:41.946
It was tails just now, so I did.

13:43.239 --> 13:44.240
Goodbye.

13:45.282 --> 13:47.117
Why don't you decide it yourself?

13:47.785 --> 13:49.370
Kanao, what do you want to do?

13:50.246 --> 13:51.580
I'm fine with anything.

13:52.081 --> 13:55.000
As I'm fine with anything,
I can't make my own decisions.

13:55.793 --> 13:58.712
I don't think it's possible
to be fine with anything in this world.

14:00.464 --> 14:04.343
It must be because the voice
inside your heart is too soft.

14:07.346 --> 14:10.307
But following orders is very important.

14:12.893 --> 14:14.270
Can you lend it to me?

14:16.897 --> 14:17.815
Thank you.

14:20.818 --> 14:22.903
All right, I'll toss this
to make a decision.

14:23.654 --> 14:25.072
What is it?

14:25.155 --> 14:26.782
To decide whether from now on,

14:26.866 --> 14:30.286
you should listen carefully
to the voice inside your heart or not.

14:35.082 --> 14:36.834
I used too much force.

14:36.917 --> 14:39.169
Heads. Please be heads!

14:39.253 --> 14:42.590
If it's heads, Kanao,
you must live by following your heart.

14:44.758 --> 14:46.260
That's odd.

14:46.343 --> 14:47.469
Where did it go?

14:49.263 --> 14:50.681
Is it there?

14:53.559 --> 14:54.810
I caught it!

14:54.894 --> 14:55.936
Kanao!

14:59.773 --> 15:01.108
Look, Kanao.

15:02.735 --> 15:04.194
Which side will it be?

15:04.278 --> 15:07.031
When the coin fell, I couldn't see
because he was blocking me.

15:09.033 --> 15:10.910
HEADS

15:10.993 --> 15:12.870
It's heads!

15:13.787 --> 15:14.747
Kanao.

15:18.667 --> 15:19.835
You can do it.

15:19.919 --> 15:22.254
The heart is the driving force for humans.

15:22.338 --> 15:24.465
The heart will keep on getting stronger.

15:27.343 --> 15:28.886
Goodbye. We'll meet again!

15:30.804 --> 15:33.349
How did you throw it to get heads?

15:36.101 --> 15:38.312
I saw he threw the coin with his hand.

15:38.395 --> 15:40.481
He didn't play dirty.

15:42.149 --> 15:43.651
It's a coincidence.

15:43.734 --> 15:48.989
Plus, even if I get tails,
I plan to throw it until I get heads.

15:54.703 --> 15:56.038
Take care!

16:11.553 --> 16:13.639
-You can do it!
-You can do it!

16:17.559 --> 16:19.478
-Yes!
-Yes!

16:19.561 --> 16:20.604
Please eat.

16:21.188 --> 16:22.523
Thank you.

16:22.606 --> 16:23.565
You can't eat it now.

16:24.149 --> 16:27.027
-Please defeat many demons.
-Please defeat many demons.

16:27.111 --> 16:28.320
I'll try my best.

16:28.404 --> 16:30.364
I told you that you can't eat!
Do you hear me?

16:30.447 --> 16:31.323
Shut up!

16:31.407 --> 16:33.325
You should shut up!

16:33.409 --> 16:34.660
Mr. Tomioka!

16:36.120 --> 16:37.705
Are you heading out on a mission now?

16:38.247 --> 16:39.206
Yes.

16:39.873 --> 16:43.627
It seems you have mastered
Constant Total Concentration Breathing.

16:43.711 --> 16:44.670
Yes.

16:45.170 --> 16:46.463
Maintain it continuously.

16:47.381 --> 16:48.298
Yes.

16:49.425 --> 16:50.467
Mr. Tomioka.

16:51.635 --> 16:54.430
Regarding Nezuko, thank you very much.

16:55.556 --> 16:57.891
You actually gamble your life for us.

16:57.975 --> 16:59.268
I didn't know about it.

16:59.935 --> 17:01.812
How should I express my gratitude?

17:03.105 --> 17:05.607
You can thank me by working hard.

17:06.567 --> 17:09.778
The duty of Demon Slayer Corps
is to slay demons.

17:09.862 --> 17:10.946
That's all I have to say.

17:12.031 --> 17:12.990
Yes!

17:15.743 --> 17:17.786
Please take care of yourself!

17:17.870 --> 17:21.040
You girls will be lonely
after I leave, won't you?

17:21.123 --> 17:23.417
I don't mind staying back.

17:23.500 --> 17:26.754
Mr. Zenitsu, when you talk to girls,

17:26.837 --> 17:29.798
please mind your words and actions
and know your limits.

17:29.882 --> 17:30.966
Yes.

17:31.050 --> 17:32.718
I feel like I'm floating.

17:32.801 --> 17:35.846
But if I'm no longer here,
you girls will feel a bit sad, won't you?

17:35.929 --> 17:37.806
-We won't feel sad at all.
-We won't feel sad at all.

17:38.807 --> 17:40.309
Goodbye, everyone.

17:41.685 --> 17:42.811
We're leaving!

17:49.068 --> 17:50.444
Hey!

17:52.029 --> 17:54.948
This…

17:55.532 --> 17:58.035
What kind of creature is this?

17:58.118 --> 17:59.578
This is it, right?

17:59.661 --> 18:01.163
The owner of this land.

18:01.246 --> 18:03.248
The ruler of this land.

18:04.208 --> 18:06.335
This length
and this feeling of oppression.

18:06.418 --> 18:07.961
I'm definitely right.

18:08.045 --> 18:09.630
It seems it's sleeping now.

18:09.713 --> 18:11.131
I mustn't let my guard down!

18:11.215 --> 18:12.424
No, it's a train.

18:12.508 --> 18:13.550
You've never seen it?

18:13.634 --> 18:15.511
Keep quiet!

18:15.594 --> 18:18.180
I'll attack first.

18:18.263 --> 18:19.598
Hang on, Inosuke!

18:20.808 --> 18:23.393
Think about it.
Maybe it's the guardian of this land.

18:23.477 --> 18:26.188
It's not appropriate
to suddenly attack it.

18:26.271 --> 18:28.816
No, I told you. It's a train.

18:28.899 --> 18:30.692
Train. Do you understand?

18:30.776 --> 18:33.112
A transportation vehicle.
It's for carrying people.

18:33.195 --> 18:34.696
You bumpkin.

18:35.531 --> 18:36.406
Train?

18:36.490 --> 18:38.575
Is this what the Kasugai Crow
was referring to?

18:42.287 --> 18:43.622
What's wrong with that guy?

18:46.625 --> 18:49.002
Rushing in like a boar!

18:49.086 --> 18:50.879
Stop it! This is embarrassing!

18:52.172 --> 18:53.841
What are you guys doing?

18:55.759 --> 18:57.469
They are carrying swords.

18:57.553 --> 18:58.554
Call the police!

18:58.637 --> 19:00.305
Call the police quickly!

19:00.389 --> 19:02.641
No! This is bad!

19:02.724 --> 19:04.393
Run now!

19:05.269 --> 19:07.229
Thanks to Inosuke, we're in trouble now!

19:07.312 --> 19:08.313
Apologize now!

19:08.397 --> 19:09.273
What?

19:09.356 --> 19:12.818
Why must we run if the police are here?

19:12.901 --> 19:16.530
Because Demon Slayer Corps
isn't recognized by the government.

19:16.613 --> 19:19.491
Actually, we can't walk in public
with our swords in view.

19:19.575 --> 19:22.828
Even if we explain what a demon is,
the people won't believe us.

19:22.911 --> 19:24.496
It will only create chaos.

19:24.580 --> 19:26.957
We are risking our lives to kill demons.

19:27.541 --> 19:29.209
We don't have a say in this matter.

19:29.293 --> 19:31.753
Anyway, let's hide our swords
on our backs.

19:35.966 --> 19:37.885
We can see them clearly.
Put a shirt on, you idiot.

19:42.181 --> 19:43.682
No way! The train is leaving.

19:43.765 --> 19:45.184
I wonder if the police are still there.

19:45.267 --> 19:46.685
We still have to go.

19:48.395 --> 19:51.106
Let's have a showdown,
the owner of this land!

19:51.190 --> 19:52.232
This idiot…

19:52.316 --> 19:53.525
Let's go too.

19:55.235 --> 19:56.320
You three!

19:57.196 --> 19:59.948
Tanjiro! Inosuke!

20:00.032 --> 20:00.949
Zenitsu!

20:10.250 --> 20:11.627
It's so fast.

20:13.795 --> 20:14.796
Tanjiro.

20:16.798 --> 20:19.218
Is it okay to bring Nezuko along?

20:20.010 --> 20:21.887
Keeping her at the headquarters
of Demon Slayer Corps

20:21.970 --> 20:23.597
should be the safest option.

20:26.975 --> 20:28.018
It's fine.

20:29.311 --> 20:32.439
No matter where we are,
Nezuko and I will always be together.

20:33.941 --> 20:36.193
I'll never part ways with her again.

20:55.504 --> 20:56.880
I'll definitely save you.

20:57.923 --> 20:59.758
I will save you!

21:01.301 --> 21:02.678
Muzan Kibutsuji!

21:03.387 --> 21:05.347
No matter where you go,

21:05.430 --> 21:07.975
I'll never let you off the hook!

21:08.058 --> 21:09.768
But we want to be together.

21:10.769 --> 21:12.271
We'll never part ways.

21:13.105 --> 21:15.565
No one can break

21:16.316 --> 21:19.820
my bond with Nezuko!

21:24.574 --> 21:25.659
Nezuko,

21:26.868 --> 21:28.078
I will definitely…

21:40.632 --> 21:42.259
INFINITE

23:27.322 --> 23:29.407
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA, THE END
OF TANJIRO KAMADO'S COMING-OF-AGE ARC

23:29.491 --> 23:30.367
Subtitle translation by Michelle Chai
